UnitDefaultGaugeCreationModule::CreateGauge
├── when the gauge factory is not allowed
│   └── it should revert with GaugeFactoryNotAllowed
├── when the target has no recorded factory
│   └── it should revert with NotAPool
├── when the recorded factory does not report the target as a pool
│   └── it should revert with NotAPool
└── when the target is a recorded pool
    ├── when neither pool token is a listed base asset
    │   └── it should revert with NoListedBaseAsset
    ├── when at least one pool token is a listed base asset
    │   ├── when both pool tokens are listed in the token registry
    │   │   ├── it should request an activated registration crediting the caller with empty factory data
    │   │   └── it should return the created gauge
    │   ├── when the second pool token is not listed in the token registry
    │   │   ├── it should request an inactive registration
    │   │   └── it should still create the gauge
    │   └── when the first pool token is not listed in the token registry
    │       ├── it should request an inactive registration
    │       └── it should still create the gauge
    └── when only the second pool token is a listed base asset
        ├── it should create the gauge
        └── it should return the created gauge
